.TH ESL-MOMENTS 1 "March 2026" "ecoSignalLab 0.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
esl-moments \- extract interesting moments as clips and timestamp tables
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B esl moments extract
.I input
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run chunked detection metrics, rank candidate windows, and export selected
moments as WAV clips plus CSV/JSON reports.
.SH SELECTION OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-single\fR
Extract only the highest-ranked moment.
.TP
\fB\-\-top-k\fR \fIN\fR
Extract top N ranked moments.
.TP
\fB\-\-all\fR
Extract all detected moments.
.SH WINDOW OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-event-window\fR \fISECONDS\fR
Symmetric clip window around event center.
.TP
\fB\-\-window-before\fR \fISECONDS\fR
Explicit time before event center.
.TP
\fB\-\-window-after\fR \fISECONDS\fR
Explicit time after event center.
.SH RANKING OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-rank-metric\fR \fIID\fR
Metric used for ranking (default: novelty_curve).
.TP
\fB\-\-metrics\fR \fILIST\fR
Comma-separated detection metric set.
.SH EXAMPLE
.B esl moments extract input_24h.wav --out out/moments --top-k 12 --rank-metric novelty_curve --window-before 5 --window-after 7
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR esl (1)
